  "authoringReviewNotes": [
    "The package targets confirmed user-based service accounts. It must not imply that service-principal or managed-identity activity is protected by this user/group policy.",
    "Trusted network inputs are tenant-resolved named-location IDs. Do not infer them from observed sign-in history.",
    "Workflow source locations must be validated before enforcement; an unrecorded cloud/vendor/home egress can break a non-human workload immediately."
  ],
